<article class="ltx_document ltx_authors_1line">
<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_title_document">Rethinking All Evidence: Enhancing Trustworthy Retrieval-Augmented Generation via Conflict-Driven Summarization</h1>
<div class="ltx_authors">
